GitHub Usage

GitHub is used to store, organize, manage, and share this 8-Puzzle A* Search project.

The project files are maintained in a GitHub repository so that changes can be tracked and previous versions can be maintained.

GitHub Workflow

Create Repository
       ↓
Add Project Files
       ↓
Commit Changes
       ↓
Push to GitHub
       ↓
Track Versions
       ↓
Share and Collaborate

GitHub helps the team maintain project documentation, update files, track progress, and collaborate during the assessment.

